GNU attributes after a class-template body: packed, aligned(16) on the
template, alignas, attribute before the body, nested aligned instances, a
plain struct containing an aligned instance (W), typedef/alias of the
instance.  sizeof and alignof must follow GCC (aligned(n) together with
packed gives exactly n).
